Note: the rules of a small coffee shop. The owner reads this file as the shop's rules,
Note: and the bot runs exactly these sentences.

remember everything in "coffee-memory.json".

Note: prices, in tenge.
the price of "latte" is 1500.
the price of "cappuccino" is 1400.
the price of "croissant" is 900.

Note: the rules.
the limit of "big order" is 5000.
the percent of "big order" is 10.
the percent of "every fifth order" is 20.
the limit of "refund days" is 14.
set owner to "Aliya".

to find the discount for a total and a count
  if the count mod 5 is 0, give back the total * the percent of "every fifth order" / 100.
  if the total is at least the limit of "big order", give back the total * the percent of "big order" / 100.
  give back 0.
that's all.

when someone sends "/start", reply "Hi, " and then their name and then "! Send me what you want, for example: latte." with buttons "/menu", "/pay" and "/refund".

when someone sends "/menu"
  for every item in the price, add item and then "-" and then the price of item and then "tenge" to their menu.
  reply their menu joined with a new line.
  set their menu to an empty list.
that's all.

when someone sends "/pay"
  if their total is 0, reply "Your order is empty.".
  otherwise
    add 1 to their orders.
    set their discount to the discount for their total and their orders.
    reply "To pay:" and then their total minus their discount and then "tenge, discount" and then their discount and then "tenge.".
    set their checkout to the current timestamp.
    set their refundable to their total minus their discount.
    set their total to 0.
  that's all.
that's all.

when someone sends "/refund"
  set their days to (the current timestamp minus their checkout) / 86400.
  if their refundable is 0, reply "There is nothing to refund.".
  otherwise, if their days is more than the limit of "refund days", reply "Refunds are possible within" and then the limit of "refund days" and then "days after paying.".
  otherwise
    reply "Refunded" and then their refundable and then "tenge.".
    set their refundable to 0.
  that's all.
that's all.

when someone sends a message that starts with "/price"
  if their name is not owner, reply "Only the owner can change prices.".
  otherwise
    set their words to the words of the message.
    set the price of item 2 of their words to item 3 of their words as a number.
    reply "New price of" and then item 2 of their words and then ":" and then item 3 of their words and then "tenge.".
  that's all.
that's all.

when someone sends anything else
  set their item to the message in lowercase.
  if the price of their item is unknown, reply "We don't have" and then their item and then ". Send /menu to see what we have.".
  otherwise
    add the price of their item to their total.
    reply "Added" and then their item and then ". Your order:" and then their total and then "tenge. Send /pay when ready.".
  that's all.
that's all.
